cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Shark Oracle, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Shark Oracle: an evidence-linked database of the global literature on sharks, rays, and chimaeras"
abstract: >-
  Shark Oracle is an AI-assisted, evidence-linked index of the research literature on sharks,
  rays, and chimaeras (elasmobranchs and holocephalans). It catalogues more than 31,000
  publications and a conference-abstract archive, records the species, places, threats,
  fishing gears, and analytical methods each study covers, and ties every label to the
  sentence that supports it. The code is released under Apache 2.0; data and documentation
  under CC BY 4.0.
